# ── ML Model artefacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Option A (recommended for small models < 50 MB): COMMIT the .pkl files.
#   → Comment out the two lines below so they are tracked by git.
#   → Teammates and deployment servers get the model automatically via git pull.
#
# Option B (large models / CI pipelines / cloud deploy): IGNORE the .pkl files.
#   → Un-comment the two lines below.
#   → Store model.pkl and scaler.pkl in cloud storage (S3, GCS, etc.)
#     and download them at deploy time via a setup script.
#
models/model.pkl
models/scaler.pkl
*.patch
